        "created_at": "2022-03-23T23:51:20.950Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay so did I misunderstand something or forget a story beat? They said it would be difficult but possible to vampire Writhe pre-oblivaeon, but basically impossible afterward.  After Oblivaeon, Writhe is still using a shard to do the whole Cosmic Inventor thing, but Voidsoul ate his shadowcloak so he’s just a guy, right?  He’s a plain old human aside from his inventions.  Why would that make him impossible to vampirize?</p>",
