        "created_at": "2022-03-23T23:55:07.117Z",
        "cooked": "<p>IIRC correctly in the Vertex line he still has Voidsoul absorbed and it takes him over.   In the RPG timeline he still has the suit and  there are consequences he has to deal from having absorbed Voidsoul for a while which leads him to becoming a villain outright.</p>",
