        "created_at": "2022-03-24T08:12:03.152Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Christopher’s way of using tokens is the way we do it too and you never run out of them that way even if playing both Unity and Captain Cosmic.</p>\n<p>I remember feeling physically sick a lot when reading Marvel Zombies, it is both graphic, gruesome, and sad. Not sure how well I would do with Vampire World, but, none the less, I am here for it.</p>",
