        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-24T22:26:09.892Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"15\" data-topic=\"29197\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So I had forgotten about The Master until Nightmist’s Kickstarter update, but now after listening to Dr. B’s letter I wonder if one of the twelve Atlantean Masters is just going around calling themself <em>the</em> Master now.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Someone definitely needs to send in a letter about that!</p>",
